WEBVTT

00:00:02.841 --> 00:00:03.841
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 3

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:11.669
<v><b>Host:</b></v> OK, Team B, now you have 30 seconds to ask Mike questions.

00:00:12.128 --> 00:00:16.291
<v><b>But remember:</b></v> Mike can only answer Yes or No.

00:00:16.855 --> 00:00:17.901
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Hello, Mike.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.850
Do you wear a uniform or special clothes?

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.921
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:00:24.419 --> 00:00:28.068
Not a uniform, but special clothes.

00:00:28.927 --> 00:00:31.537
<v><b>George:</b></v> Do you have special qualifications?

00:00:32.085 --> 00:00:33.760
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:00:34.529 --> 00:00:35.967
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Do you work on a team?

00:00:36.419 --> 00:00:37.014
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> No.

00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:40.758
But sometimes other people help me.

00:00:41.392 --> 00:00:45.669
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Remember, Mike, you can only answer Yes or No.

00:00:46.177 --> 00:00:48.528
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Oh, yes. Sorry.

00:00:49.306 --> 00:00:51.235
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Do you work inside?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.338
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:00:54.009 --> 00:00:55.715
<v><b>George:</b></v> Do you work on the weekend?

00:00:56.207 --> 00:00:57.897
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> No, I don’t.

00:00:58.955 --> 00:01:00.257
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Do you like your job?

00:01:00.741 --> 00:01:02.400
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I love it.

00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:05.706
But people don’t always like me!

00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:07.614
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Thank you, Mike.

00:01:08.264 --> 00:01:14.652
So, Team B, is Mike a hair stylist, a dentist, or a chef?

00:01:15.248 --> 00:01:16.837
You have one minute.